00:00:31.817 --> 00:00:32.650
I have a son,

00:00:32.650 --> 00:00:33.483
you know what I mean?

00:00:33.483 --> 00:00:34.316
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:00:34.316 --> 00:00:35.149
- And when you go through a breakup,

00:00:35.149 --> 00:00:36.744
you wanna be a role model as well, right?

00:00:36.744 --> 00:00:37.577
- Yeah.

00:00:37.577 --> 00:00:38.410
- You lead by example.

00:00:38.410 --> 00:00:40.118
You don't want him to do that.

00:00:40.118 --> 00:00:40.951
- Yeah.

00:00:40.951 --> 00:00:41.784
- So, like,

00:00:41.784 --> 00:00:42.617
his mommy,

00:00:42.617 --> 00:00:43.450
it's like we're best friends.

00:00:43.450 --> 00:00:44.413
To this day, we're best friends.

00:00:44.413 --> 00:00:45.447
- [Kelly] I remember you
telling me that. Yeah.

00:00:45.447 --> 00:00:46.375
- Yeah. She lives right in front of me.

00:00:46.375 --> 00:00:47.539
I have a house right in front of me,

00:00:47.539 --> 00:00:49.139
and that's where she lives.

00:00:49.139 --> 00:00:50.254
- That's awesome.

00:00:50.254 --> 00:00:52.270
- Yeah. She's got all the keys to my cars,

00:00:52.270 --> 00:00:53.737
the codes and everything.

00:00:53.737 --> 00:00:55.118
And like, when I'm on the road, like,

00:00:55.118 --> 00:00:56.398
I don't have to worry about anything.

00:00:56.398 --> 00:00:57.593
- That's like incredibly healthy.

00:00:57.593 --> 00:00:58.835
- Yes. It's so healthy.

00:00:58.835 --> 00:00:59.668
- Yeah.

00:00:59.668 --> 00:01:00.501
- And it can work.

00:01:00.501 --> 00:01:01.334
- Yeah.

00:01:01.334 --> 00:01:02.167
You guys were friends before.

00:01:02.167 --> 00:01:03.000
You can be friends after.

00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:03.874
- I know. I think so.

00:01:03.874 --> 00:01:04.707
- Yes

00:01:04.707 --> 00:01:05.540
- Okay. I agree. I agree.

00:01:05.540 --> 00:01:06.373
- [Jo] Yeah.

00:01:06.373 --> 00:01:07.206
