00:01:08.930 --> 00:01:09.763
- Yes.

00:01:09.763 --> 00:01:10.596
- What'd you, I've never been to Dubai.

00:01:10.596 --> 00:01:11.694
- [Jo] You have to go.

00:01:11.694 --> 00:01:12.527
- [Kelly] I've never been. Yeah.

00:01:12.527 --> 00:01:13.506
- [Jo] I was at Coca-Cola Arena.

00:01:13.506 --> 00:01:14.589
It was massive.

00:01:14.589 --> 00:01:15.422
Everyone was there,

00:01:15.422 --> 00:01:18.137
and you can do anything in Dubai.

00:01:18.137 --> 00:01:19.730
So, anything!

00:01:19.730 --> 00:01:21.603
I saw a penguin for the first time.

00:01:21.603 --> 00:01:22.937
- You mean one of the big, huge ones?

00:01:22.937 --> 00:01:23.945
- No. I saw a penguin.

00:01:23.945 --> 00:01:24.778
Like,

00:01:24.778 --> 00:01:26.062
