00:01:27.919 --> 00:01:30.616
(Kelly laughs)

00:01:30.616 --> 00:01:31.449
- I've never seen a zebra.

00:01:31.449 --> 00:01:32.366
- Penguins? We have 20 of them right here.

00:01:32.366 --> 00:01:34.035
(both laugh)

00:01:34.035 --> 00:01:35.438
Dubai has everything.

00:01:35.438 --> 00:01:36.734
I was skiing in Dubai.

00:01:36.734 --> 00:01:38.260
I was like, I bought shoes at Foot Locker,

00:01:38.260 --> 00:01:39.491
I was like, I feel like going skiing.

00:01:39.491 --> 00:01:40.771
And then we went skiing.

00:01:40.771 --> 00:01:41.725
