00:01:44.883 --> 00:01:45.716
did your feet and everything.

00:01:45.716 --> 00:01:46.549
- Oh my God.

00:01:46.549 --> 00:01:47.464
My son was snowboarding, I'm like,

00:01:47.464 --> 00:01:49.260
