00:01:49.260 --> 00:01:51.048
- That's awesome!

00:01:51.048 --> 00:01:52.482
I prefer snowboarding over skiing, too.

00:01:52.482 --> 00:01:53.555
Well, I prefer none of that now.

00:01:53.555 --> 00:01:54.441
It's, nope.

00:01:54.441 --> 00:01:55.274
- No.

00:01:55.274 --> 00:01:56.107
- But wait,

00:01:56.107 --> 00:01:57.161
