building in the world?

00:01:57.161 --> 00:01:57.994
That's there, right?

00:01:57.994 --> 00:01:58.827
- Yeah, Burj Khalifa.

00:01:58.827 --> 00:01:59.660
- Oh, okay.

00:01:59.660 --> 00:02:00.493
- Burj Khalifa.

00:02:00.493 --> 00:02:01.326
- Burj Khalifa.

00:02:01.326 --> 00:02:02.159
- I don't know if you guys know that,

00:02:02.159 --> 00:02:03.491
but Burj Khalifa is a a skyscraper

00:02:03.491 --> 00:02:04.905
