00:02:04.905 --> 00:02:06.674
Oh, there it is.

00:02:06.674 --> 00:02:07.586
Look at this thing.

00:02:07.586 --> 00:02:10.423
- That would worry me
to be in that building.

00:02:10.423 --> 00:02:11.256
