00:02:15.192 --> 00:02:16.499
- [Kelly] Yeah. I'm not
even afraid of heights.

00:02:16.499 --> 00:02:17.332
- Yeah.

00:02:17.332 --> 00:02:18.165
- I just don't know.

00:02:18.165 --> 00:02:18.998
It just sticks-

00:02:18.998 --> 00:02:19.831
I don't like to stand out like that.

00:02:19.831 --> 00:02:20.664
- Mm

00:02:20.664 --> 00:02:21.497
- [Kelly] Yeah, yeah.

00:02:21.497 --> 00:02:22.330
- No, you wouldn't wanna
be on top of that thing.

00:02:22.330 --> 00:02:23.163
- [Kelly] Nope.

00:02:23.163 --> 00:02:23.996
- Yeah. I wanted to go down.

00:02:23.996 --> 00:02:25.172
I don't like heights.

00:02:25.172 --> 00:02:26.005
- Oh.

00:02:26.005 --> 00:02:27.406
- So, when you look down

00:02:27.406 --> 00:02:28.761
and you see a skyscraper below you,

00:02:28.761 --> 00:02:30.209
you're like, okay, yeah, this is too high.

00:02:30.209 --> 00:02:31.042
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:02:31.042 --> 00:02:31.875
- This is too high.

00:02:31.875 --> 00:02:33.284
- I'm not afraid of heights.

00:02:33.284 --> 00:02:34.117
It's just,

00:02:34.117 --> 00:02:36.136
I feel like you're a target.

00:02:36.136 --> 00:02:37.283
I don't know. It just feels like a target.

00:02:37.283 --> 00:02:38.116
