00:04:21.559 --> 00:04:22.392
Yes!

00:04:23.507 --> 00:04:26.524
- [Kelly] Exactly. Exactly.

00:04:26.524 --> 00:04:27.908
- [Jo] Yes!

00:04:27.908 --> 00:04:28.741
- Exactly.

00:04:28.741 --> 00:04:29.858
